review:83481_r115 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83481 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "La construction de l'Arc de Triomphe, commencée en 1806, fut interrompue par la mort de Chalgrin en 1811, et finalement terminée en 1836. En tout, elle coûta près de 10 millions de francs-or" .

review:83481_r116 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83481 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Paris Museum Pass gets you to the top for free and you can skip the ticket line. There's an elevator for those who physically cannot take the stairs, though there is still about 30 steps to the top." .

