    schema1:reviewBody "Y a quand meme un turn over meme sur l expo permanente c est cool" .

review:83523_r104 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "C'est trop difficile de trouver une place libre, le week-end essayer de venir une heure avant l'heure d'ouverture" .

review:83523_r105 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "L'affluence au Centre Pompidou varie beaucoup en fonction des expositions en cours Evitez donc si possible les mois de juin, septembre et février (Période de changements d'expositions)." .

review:83523_r106 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Les billets achetés en ligne vous permettent d'éviter les files d'attente. Pour d'autres astuces gain de temps, cliquez sur" .

review:83523_r107 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "The Pompidou Center hosts the largest museum for modern art in all of Europe. Try the entrance located at the back for a quicker entrance into the National Museum of Modern Art!" .

review:83523_r108 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Modern mimarinin güzel bir örneği. Sürekli koleksiyonu harika. Süeli sergileri de takiop etmeli. Biz Edward Munch sergisine denk gelmiştik, müthiş bir deneyimdi." .

review:83523_r109 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Wi-Fiがある。ミュージアムショップは書籍とポストカードの品揃えがかなり豊富。" .

review:83523_r11 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "RDV en haut lieu de l’art contempo parisien. Un tuyau ? il porte le nom d’un président de la république française." .

review:83523_r110 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Tienen que visitarlo!" .

review:83523_r111 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Expo Dali au centre Pompidou du 21 novembre au 25 mars 2013" .

review:83523_r112 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Das Centre Pompidou besitzt eine hervorragende Sammlung der Kunst des 20. Jh. Wer das Museum besucht, bekommt zudem den wunderbaren Panoramablick über die Stadt vom Dach des Centres gratis dazu." .

review:83523_r113 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "one of my favourite places in Paris.. enjoyed my time 100%.." .

review:83523_r114 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "N'oubliez pas les festivals, séances de cinéma, pièces de théâtre et conférences qui ont lieu en plus des fabuleuses expos !" .

review:83523_r115 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "il faut y aller" .

review:83523_r116 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Un musée moder avec des oeuvres très intéressantes. La partie design industriel pourrait être complété." .

review:83523_r117 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "建于1989年的蓬皮杜现代艺术中心,已成为巴黎第二受欢迎的博物 馆,也是全球游客最多的十大博物馆之一;而这个“奇怪的庞然大 物”本身就是一个后现代建筑艺术品,你可以从颜色去区别她的水 电排气电梯系统:蓝色是空调排气系统,黄色是电力系统,绿色是 水管,红色则是电梯;顶层的咖啡也是个休闲的好地方。" .

review:83523_r118 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "If there is a big line....ask if there is VIP access for French people. Worked for me!" .

review:83523_r119 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Pour éviter de faire la queue à l'entrée du musée, accédez par l'ascenseur extérieur pour aller au restaurant et redescendez" .

review:83523_r12 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Inauguré en 1977, le centre Pompidou accueillait en 2006 6,6 millions de visiteurs par an[1], ce qui en fait la troisième institution la plus visitée en France" .

review:83523_r120 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Отличный вид на весь Париж!" .

review:83523_r121 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Toujours passer par la E-billetterie avant de venir à Paris. Expo Dali blindée !" .

review:83523_r122 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Every first Sunday of the month it is free entrance and around 18:00 there is no big line for entrance!" .

review:83523_r123 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Enjoy the spectacular views of Paris as you enjoy world-class art" .

review:83523_r124 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "allez voir le festival \"hors pistes\" de vidéos expérimentales, c'est déroutant : ça a commencé ce soir au cinéma 2 du centre pompidou" .

review:83523_r125 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Waiting lines to enter the building, for the ticket offices, cloakroom and for the exhibitions; but free wifi to pass time while waiting!" .

review:83523_r126 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "rumoaobetalab!!" .

review:83523_r127 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "По вторникам не работает. А чтобы попасть на выставку Дали, нужно ждать 2 часа" .

review:83523_r128 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Hay free wifi en la cafetería" .

review:83523_r129 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Имеет большой смысл планировать визит после 18-00 - очередь растворяется и у вас есть четыре полных часа без толпы посмотреть экспозицию" .

review:83523_r13 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Love the museum architecture, they always have great exhibitions, the restaurant on top have superb view" .

review:83523_r130 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Потрясающая новая экспозиция по-живописи! Восторг" .

review:83523_r131 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Such a nice bird's-eye view on Paris from the 6th floor! Awesome! Also sometimes it's faster to enter if you buy the tickets right here. The line with ones with tickets was much longer today.." .

review:83523_r132 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Buy ticket online,or you have to wait for 1 hour line! Be here early as possible in the morning to catch Dali exhibition" .

review:83523_r133 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Chaque couleur de tuyaux a son rôle: le bleu – pour l’air, le vert – pour l’eau, le jaune – pour les fils électriques, le rouge – pour le mouvement (escaliers, ascenseurs, etc)." .

review:83523_r134 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Free wi-fi" .

review:83523_r135 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Houses the largest collection of modern art in Europe. Great special exhibitions! For a nice break in between exhibitions, you can go to Georges on the museum’s top floor." .

review:83523_r136 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Ernesto Neto, \"We stopped just here at the time\" (la cannella si fa arte :-))" .

review:83523_r137 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "good place for modern art" .

review:83523_r138 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "One of my favourite place in Paris" .

review:83523_r139 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Acceso al ultimo piso 3€. Mirador VUE DE PARIS. Sin acceso al museo. En el bar un espresso 3€" .

review:83523_r14 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "The cinematheque has tributes to great directors and thematic festivals. Recent retrospectives have included homages to Jean-Luc Godard, and Canadian film director Guy Maddin. Click for more." .

review:83523_r140 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "This is one of the world's leading collections of modern art. Everything from Pollock, to Warhol to Miro are on display in this piece of modern architecture. Definitely a must-see when in Paris" .

review:83523_r141 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Absolutely worth the €3 for a 360 of Paris on a sunny day. Stick around for sunset- stunning!" .

review:83523_r142 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Make your way to the top of the museum for one of the best views of the city. Also, there's free wifi and coat check." .

review:83523_r143 a schema1:Review ;
