    schema1:about place:83523 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "The Restaurant at the top of Centre Pompidou is a rip-off, and has no good food to offer. Better get something outside, but don't forget to take the \"Paris from above impressions\" with you." .

