review:83619_r10 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:83619 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Great homage to French architecture. Don’t miss the reproduction of the Chartres Cathedral’s stained-glass window: it’s stunning. This museum also has an amazing panoramic view of Paris!" .

