    schema1:reviewBody "Súper bon bières! Service très sympa :)" .

review:86178_r3 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Très bel endroit, très bonnes bières! Super bar pour une soirée entre bons amis!" .

review:86178_r4 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "The place for beer enthusiasts in Paris. One of the best beer bars I've ever been to. Great atmosphere and music. Owners, working at the bar, are friendly and opened for beer discussion." .

review:86178_r5 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "More than 100 bottles and 20 beers on tap (priced 3,5-6€ for 1/2 pint). Tap beers are rotating. Try excellent french craft beers like Dalva or Silvanecte. They open at 5pm and close at 2am." .

review:86178_r6 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Go for the \"Hardcore IPA\" on tap." .

review:86178_r7 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Super bar, surtout pour les passionnés de bière. Ambiance sympa également. Je le recommande vivement !!" .

review:86178_r8 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Big, cozy and with a good soundtrack, you can find 20 rotating beers on tap from all around the world. The french beer Agent Provocateur is outstanding. Nice, and English-speaking, staff." .

review:86178_r9 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86178 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "This is Paris’ only craft beer bar – of its selections: cult-status I.P.A.’s, Trappiste brews and a smoked lager that tastes strangely like bacon. For more, follow us on 4sq or at www.renhotels.com." .

