review:86609_r13 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "We love the higgledy-piggledy medieval streets and the artsy-boho vibes. It’s the perfect spot for an afternoon of shopping and museum hopping or a laidback evening on the town." .

review:86609_r14 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "This neighborhood was once a favorite urban spot for French nobility. Now it's a shopper's paradise and home to some of Paris's best falafel, found at L'As du Falafel." .

review:86609_r15 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Jewish & Gay district in the center of Paris. Very trendy by night with some chill-out bars. to find your cheap here in the Marais ;) http://awe.sm/5dpMb" .

