review:86609_r2 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "马亥区真是个好地方，除了博物馆和名人故居云集，还有很多1900s的古董、艺术品商店和卖小玩意的地方，价格比起左岸要平易近人许多，应是巴黎最佳购物地。我在Forney艺术图书馆附近的一个穹顶花园般的购物广场 St Paul 买了几顶精美绝伦的欧式帽子，即便戴去参加皇家赛马日也毫不失礼。附近还有便宜到笑的vintage店，以及以色列小吃 (因为附近还有一个历史悠久的犹太人区）。" .

review:86609_r20 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Trendy neighborhood in the center of Paris. Lots of shops and restaurants. Great for gift shopping and people watching! Beautiful at night with the lights in drizzling rain." .

review:86609_r21 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Lots of really cool street art at every corner! look up and around" .

review:86609_r22 a schema1:Review ;
    schema1:about place:86609 ;
    schema1:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema1:reviewBody "Mon quartier préféré de Paris. Évidemment. Que dire de plus ? <3" .

